+* \[`2ac2440522`] - permission: handle process.chdir on writereport (RafaelGSS)
+* \[`7854faf34e`] - tls: normalize hostname for server identity checks (Matteo Collina)
+* \[`205e258de2`] - http2: cap originSet size to prevent unbounded memory growth (Matteo Collina)
